#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This Procedure demonstrates a common Double Lane Change handling test but with a shortened preview time.
#
#The driver preview time has been shortened to 0.5 seconds to generate more aggressive steering. The preview time on the steering control blue link "Double Lane Change (Quick Start)" is set to 1 second, so it is overridden on this screen in the yellow field for Additional Data.
#
#The driver controls specify a closed-loop speed control with a constant target speed of 48 kph. In this example, both the speed and braking control are defined on the Target speed vs. station screen.
#
#Click on the blue link "Constant 48 km/h" for more information.
#
#Other driver controls include automatic gear selection using all available gears.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

